    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE",
    "describe_ch": "This course teaches what every student should know about Artificial Intelligence. AI is a fast-moving technology with impacts and implications for both our individual lives and society as a whole. In this course, students will get a basic introduction to the building blocks and components of artificial intelligence. Students will also learn basic concepts of machine learning and learn how to use python to implement it.",
